---------------------------------------------------------------------
PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
30-turn game. Zikale ran a Primitive Furnace/Single-Shot Rifle ping engine to destroy own overcosted Astegon copies (turns 3, 7) while chip-attacking with Pengullet/Univolt/Chillet/Elphidran Aqua/Elphidran. Tuk0Shade's Reindrix/Foxparks interrupted several Zikale attacks (turns 1, 11, 23 bare-form); Zikale's own attacks were nullified by Tuk0Shade's Cryolinx and repeated Pyrin Noct interrupts (turns 9, 19, 21, 27). Several combat trades occurred: Tuk0Shade's Chillet destroyed Zikale's Elphidran Aqua (turn 13) and Pengullet (turn 11); Zikale's Foxparks traded with Tuk0Shade's Cryolinx (turn 22); Zikale's Elphidran Aqua traded with Tuk0Shade's Maraith (turn 30). Zikale ground Tuk0Shade down via Jormuntide Ignis/Chillet/Elphidran chip damage (10->6->4->2), and Tuk0Shade surrendered at 2 life vs Zikale's 5.


